{"channelId":"UCbJBh2MFKrX6Lf8bJ7_ZGWQ","row":["Guy's and St Thomas' NHS Foundation Trust",24600,"We are one of the UK's largest NHS Foundation Trusts, providing acute and specialist services at St Thomas', Guy's, and Evelina London Children's Hospital, Royal Brompton and Harefield Hospitals, and both adult and children's community services in Lambeth and Southwark.\n\nDedication to the communities we serve is at the heart of what we do, with high quality, personal care for every patient we treat.\n\nWe are guided by our values in everything that we do. We are: caring, ambitious, inclusive.\n\nOur governors and members help to make us a successful NHS foundation trust by ensuring that we meet the needs and expectations of our patients.\n\nAs part of King's Health Partners, an academic health sciences centre, we are pioneers in health research, and provide high quality teaching and education. This partnership helps us provide the latest treatments for our patients alongside the best possible care.","","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbJBh2MFKrX6Lf8bJ7_ZGWQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbJBh2MFKrX6Lf8bJ7_ZGWQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:05.922Z","channelId":"UCbJBh2MFKrX6Lf8bJ7_ZGWQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"b112849ed5afa98ade548d6f8cd66c0a48f9baa19a74ab8e8b7fe95dba5d666d","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"8f9e26c8c897d748172a043d6e0452bc2ed3b567aea2931850fbf69d218cf42e"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbJBh2MFKrX6Lf8bJ7_ZGWQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:05.922Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbJBh2MFKrX6Lf8bJ7_ZGWQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":24600,"raw":"24.6K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbJBh2MFKrX6Lf8bJ7_ZGWQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:05.922Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[{"url":"https://www.guysand